格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DeepSeek Harness plugin: 15 obra/superpowers engineering skills, bilingual descriptions, per-skill toggles | DeepSeek Harness 插件：15 个 obra/superpowers 工程纪律技能，技能描述中英双语自由切换，每一个技能本身自由开关","id":"gh:1342065278","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-superpower","slug":"Wenaixi/dsh-superpower","topics":["ai-agent","brainstorming","chinese","code-review","cordis","debugging","deepseek","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","methodology","planning","plugin","productivity","sdlc","skills","subagent","superpowers","tdd","typescript"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness plugin: 15 obra/superpowers engineering skills, bilingual descriptions, per-skill t"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"oggles | DeepSeek Harness 插件：15 个 obra/superpowers 工程纪律技能，技能描述中英双语自由切换，每一个技能本身自由开关"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-superpower"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"A DSH port of obra/superpowers. 15 skills are injected into `ctx.skills`. Skill bodies are the offic"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"ial English originals; the panel switches the description each skill shows in the model catalog and "},{"id":"p4s3","text":"the slash-command (`/`) skill menu between Chinese and English, while skill names stay as upstream E"},{"id":"p4s4","text":"sh-command (`/`) skill menu between Chinese and English, while skill names stay as upstream English."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"Needs the dsh runtime (adapted to latest `v0.2.1-rc.2` / `>=0.2.0-rc.2` via `npm i -g @deepseek-ai/d"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"sh`); Node and pnpm floors are in the badges above. Examples use the `web` profile; substitute your "},{"id":"p6s3","text":"pm floors are in the badges above. Examples use the `web` profile; substitute your own profile name."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"Pin a version by appending `@<version>` or `#v<version>` (the version currently published; check `np"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"m view @wenaixi/dsh-superpower version`)."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"Local development or offline install:"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## What it is"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"A prescriptive engineering methodology: design first, slice the plan into verifiable steps, drive wi"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"th tests, find the root cause before fixing, and run verification commands before claiming completio"},{"id":"p12s3","text":"n. It ships as a `dsh.bundle`, writes nothing into your home directory, uninstalls cleanly, and rebu"},{"id":"p12s4","text":"ilds itself through HMR."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"Skill bodies are the upstream English originals (DSH-adapted: symbols, platform references, DSH-only"},{"id":"p13s2","text":" sections). Each `SKILL.md` declares both an English `description` and a Chinese `description_zh`; t"},{"id":"p13s3","text":"he panel's language switch picks which one the model sees, without changing the body."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## Skills"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"| Skill | When to use |"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"| `using-superpowers` | Start of every conversation: check for applicable skills before anything els"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"e |\n| `brainstorming` | Before creative work: clarify intent, requirements, and design |\n| `writing-"},{"id":"p16s3","text":"plans` | Once the design is settled, slice it into verifiable tasks |\n| `using-git-worktrees` | When"},{"id":"p16s4","text":" work needs an isolated workspace |\n| `executing-plans` | Execute the plan yourself in this session "},{"id":"p16s5","text":"|\n| `subagent-driven-development` | A plan with independent tasks, dispatched to subagents |\n| `disp"},{"id":"p16s6","text":"atching-parallel-agents` | Two or more independent tasks, dispatched in parallel |\n| `test-driven-de"},{"id":"p16s7","text":"velopment` | Write the test before the implementation |\n| `systematic-debugging` | A bug appeared: f"},{"id":"p16s8","text":"ind the root cause before proposing fixes |\n| `verification-before-completion` | Run verification co"},{"id":"p16s9","text":"mmands before claiming completion |\n| `requesting-code-review` | Request review after finishing work"},{"id":"p16s10","text":", before a PR |\n| `receiving-code-review` | Verify review feedback technically before implementing i"},{"id":"p16s11","text":"t |\n| `diagnosing-superpowers` | A session went wrong or cost too much: find out why |\n| `finishing-"},{"id":"p16s12","text":"a-development-branch` | Decide whether to merge, open a PR, or keep the branch |\n| `writing-skills` "},{"id":"p16s13","text":"| Create or edit a skill |"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"Tool mapping (Bash to pwsh, Read/Write to fs, and so on) lives in `skills/using-superpowers/referenc"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"h to pwsh, Read/Write to fs, and so on) lives in `skills/using-superpowers/references/dsh-tools.md`."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"### Same-name precedence"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"The official registry arbitrates same-layer name collisions by ascending `rank`. This bundle registe"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"rs at rank 10, below `dsh-skill-filesystem` project and user roots (100-500) and official bundled sk"},{"id":"p19s3","text":"ills (600). Whenever a same-name skill exists, this bundle's copy wins and the two rule sets never f"},{"id":"p19s4","text":"(600). Whenever a same-name skill exists, this bundle's copy wins and the two rule sets never fight."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## Skill switches and language"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"Open the `@wenaixi/dsh-superpower` card in the plugin manager; the panel sits at the bottom of its d"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"wenaixi/dsh-superpower` card in the plugin manager; the panel sits at the bottom of its detail page."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"- One switch per skill. Off means both sides lose it: the model no longer sees it in the available-s"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"kill catalog and `skill` tool calls are rejected; you can no longer reach it from slash-command comp"},{"id":"p22s3","text":"letion or the CLI skill list.\n- A 3-state segmented control (`中文 / English / 跟随宿主（自动）`) at the top o"},{"id":"p22s4","text":"f the panel switches the description language of all 15 skills at once. It changes only the `Superpo"},{"id":"p22s5","text":"wer Skill:` text: the rest of the panel stays in the Host UI language and skill bodies stay English."},{"id":"p22s6","text":" Both descriptions carry the `Superpower Skill:` / `Superpower Skill：` prefix. When unset, descripti"},{"id":"p22s7","text":"ons follow the Host UI language (the language chosen in settings) and the control displays an indica"},{"id":"p22s8","text":"tor; picking `中文` or `English` locks the selection, and picking `跟随宿主（自动）` resets to following the H"},{"id":"p22s9","text":"ost. The choice is stored as a `language` preference in the profile (unset when following the Host)."},{"id":"p22s10","text":"\n- The panel header carries enable-all, disable-all, restore-defaults, and a search box.\n- Changes t"},{"id":"p22s11","text":"ake effect immediately; the running turn is unaffected and the next turn sees the new catalog and la"},{"id":"p22s12","text":"nguage.\n- State lives in the profile's `cordis.patch.yml` (`disabled` and `language` tables) and tra"},{"id":"p22s13","text":"vels with the profile.\n- Only this bundle's 15 skills are affected; official and third-party skills "},{"id":"p22s14","text":"profile.\n- Only this bundle's 15 skills are affected; official and third-party skills are untouched."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## Usage"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"Check: `await ctx.skills.list({cwd})` should return 15 entries with `provider: superpowers`."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"## Development"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"### Browser verification"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"Optional. Needs dsh and Python playwright installed locally. Both scripts take every address and pat"},{"id":"p29s2","text":"h from the command line:"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"| Script | What it verifies |"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"| `scripts/browser/verify-switch-ui.py` | Real Web UI: open the plugin card, flip switches, click bu"},{"id":"p31s2","text":"lk buttons, search-filter, then read `cordis.patch.yml` back |\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"## Layout"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
